<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Foundation Health started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Foundation Health started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Foundation Health Systems Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said company is poised to become one of the strongest competitors in the key California HMO market.</p>
<p>-- set an 18-month price target of $43 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- expects Foundation Health to earn $2.40 a share in 1997 and $2.85 in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Foundation Health shares were unchanged at 27-1/8.</p>
</text>
